{"findings":[{"id":"a637e811-d3f3-46a2-8d13-85ccabfe342b","title":"Modulo by zero crashes instead of returning NULL","description":"The zero-divisor guard in `apply` was narrowed from `Token::Slash | Token::Percent` to `Token::Slash`, so `%` with a zero right operand no longer returns `Ok(None)` and falls through to `Token::Percent => Some(a.wrapping_rem(b))`, which panics on a zero divisor. Any SQL containing modulo by zero, including nested forms such as `2 * (3 % 0)` and queries run through the sqllogictest harness, panics instead of yielding NULL, contradicting the README's documented \"Division or modulo by zero gives NULL.\" rule.","category":"Correctness","action_level":"action_required","attribution_status":"pending","git_sha":"559dc2a00191c3ad16a6aa1cfbc151ae6b0885a0","location":{"file_path":"src/select.rs","start_line":156,"end_line":157,"side":"right"},"evidence":{"citations":[{"source_type":"rules","source":"https://app.qodo.ai/rules/5040758?state=active"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"src/select.rs[153-161]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"README.md[69-69]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"src/select.rs[156-161]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"src/select.rs[716-735]"},{"source_type":"pr_branch_file","source":"tests/slt.rs[275-283]"}]}}],"finding_state":{"complete":true,"introduced":[],"resolved":[],"still_open":["a637e811-d3f3-46a2-8d13-85ccabfe342b"],"dismissed":[]},"review_agent_comment":"The README and comment edits are fine, but the guard change in `apply` is a regression: the modulo-by-zero case was dropped from the NULL guard, and the surviving `wrapping_rem` path panics. The existing unit test `zero_division_and_null` should have caught this. Please restore the `Percent` arm in the guard and re-run the test suite before merge.","meta":{"analysis":{"attempted_mode":"incremental","baseline_checkpoint_id":"7be7e7f42efe4fa9b81fc6a0685c38f9","mode":"reused","profile_changed":false,"reason":"snapshot_unchanged"},"checkpoint":{"base_sha":"559dc2a00191c3ad16a6aa1cfbc151ae6b0885a0","coverage_started_at":"2026-11-28T03:45:35.072406+00:00","created_at":"2026-11-28T03:46:33.274993+00:00","id":"9ed2037f7cee405e96fd81624b718a3e","sequence":42569,"tree_sha":"252ba39f17824348f28e2a66015c1476898122af","version":1},"context":{"ticket_bodies":[{"index":1,"input_chars":2605,"max_tokens":5000,"offloaded":false,"original_tokens":651,"outcome":"inline","rendered_chars":2605}]},"coverage":{"complete":true},"depth":"auto","org_config":"applied","reviewers":{"ran":[],"skipped":["issue","compliance","skills","spec","ui","persona","cross_repo"]},"run":{"effort":{"effective":null,"requested":"auto"},"id":"7b2f9994ae124be7ae6365930fa4c674","passes":[],"reused_from":{"effective_effort":"lite","finished_at":"2026-11-28T03:46:11.057282+00:00","run_id":"34529394802546f79df4c35c8eba24a3"},"snapshot":{"base_sha":"559dc2a00191c3ad16a6aa1cfbc151ae6b0885a0","commit_sha":"559dc2a00191c3ad16a6aa1cfbc151ae6b0885a0","tree_sha":"252ba39f17824348f28e2a66015c1476898122af"},"timing":{"duration_ms":2949,"finished_at":"2026-11-28T03:46:36.224014+00:00","started_at":"2026-11-28T03:46:33.274993+00:00"}},"safety_net":{"ran":false,"reinjected":0},"skipped_files":[],"local_review_ids":{"a637e811-d3f3-46a2-8d13-85ccabfe342b":"ce2274ad-c0b8-4e44-87ce-f9d190e2d4b2"}}}
